<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Amazônia Viva | Conscientização e Preservação</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header role="banner">
        <nav aria-label="Navegação Principal">
            <div class="logo">Amazônia<span>Viva</span></div>
            <div class="accessibility-controls">
                <button onclick="changeFontSize('increase')" aria-label="Aumentar fonte">A+</button>
                <button onclick="changeFontSize('decrease')" aria-label="Diminuir fonte">A-</button>
                <button onclick="toggleContrast()" aria-label="Alternar Alto Contraste">◐</button>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content">
        <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
            <div class="container">
                <h1 id="hero-title">O Pulmão do Mundo pede socorro.</h1>
                <p>Entenda o impacto do desmatamento e como podemos reverter esse cenário.</p>
                <a href="#impactos" class="btn-primary">Saiba Mais</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="dados" class="container reveal" aria-labelledby="dados-title">
            <h2 id="dados-title">Estatísticas Atuais</h2>
            <div id="grid-dados" class="grid-container">
                </div>
        </section>

        <section id="causas" class="carousel-section reveal" aria-labelledby="causas-title">
            <h2 id="causas-title">Principais Causas</h2>
            <div class="carousel-container" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel">
                <div id="carousel-track" class="carousel-track">
                    </div>
                <div class="carousel-nav">
                    <button class="prev" aria-label="Slide anterior">❮</button>
                    <button class="next" aria-label="Próximo slide">❯</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="solucoes" class="container reveal" aria-labelledby="solucoes-title">
            <h2 id="solucoes-title">Como Ajudar</h2>
            <div id="accordion-group" class="accordion">
                </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer role="contentinfo">
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Amazônia Viva - Projeto Educativo.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
